177284,SEL-PL79041,mohammad,Pulsar Challenger 1x20 DOS Adapters Accessories,Sellmark Pulsar Challenger 1x20 DOS Adapters Accessories,1,59.990,49.970,,"* Converts daytime riflescope for nighttime shooting (used with PL74095) <br /> <EOL>* Wide choice of reduction rings to fit various riflescopes<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Description:</b><br /> <EOL>* The Pulsar DOS adapter allows the user to use the Challenger GS 1x20 and Challenger G2+ 1x21 night vision monoculars with optical day riflescopes for nighttime shooting. <br /> <EOL>* This unit enables the adapter to be affixed onto virtually any day riflescope, turning the unit into a night vision unit for maximum use.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,4.500,3.500,3.500,1000,Y,57654,Sellmark Corporation/Accessories/Pulsar,,51.800,,Saturday 15 December 2012 04:12:16 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,908,810471004621,40,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
