176639,SEL-PL72091,mohammad,Pulsar Expert VM 8x40 Marine Binoculars,Sellmark Pulsar Expert VM 8x40 Marine Binoculars,3,479.990,399.970,,"* Progressive optical system based on the 2nd type Porro Prism, <br /> <EOL>* Nitrogen purged optical system<br /> <EOL>* Exterior protective Eclipse-M lens caps<br /> <EOL>* Ergonomic eye cups<br /> <EOL>* Adjustable eyepieces<br /> <EOL>* Durable glass-filled nylon composite housing<br /> <EOL>* Anti-reflection coating<br /> <EOL>* Noticeable bright yellow inserts<br /> <EOL><br /><b>Description:</b><br /> <EOL>* Uniquely designed for maximum protection and comfort, the Pulsar Expert VM 8x40 Binoculars Marine feature yellow lens caps and yellow inserts in the eyepieces to make the unit more visible. <br /> <EOL>* Its protective flat front lenses prevent against scratches, dust, sand and moisture. <br /> <EOL>* With switchable, internal filters the Pulsar Expert VM 8x40 Binoculars Marine include three modes: a reflection mode that neutralizes glare, a contrast mode that enhances images during twilight hours and a daylight mode.<br /> <EOL>* Featuring adjustable, ergonomic eye cups, the Pulsar Expert VM 8x40 Binoculars Marine maximize comfort and block out extraneous light, preventing images from being washed out. <br /> <EOL>* These state-of-the-art binoculars include attached Eclipse-M lens caps for continuous defense.<br /> <EOL>* With a protection rating of IP67, the unit is nitrogen-purged, fog proof and 100% impervious to dust and water. <br /> <EOL>* The Pulsar Expert VM 8x40 Binoculars Marine can be submerged to 1 meter for up to 30 minutes without acquiring any damage.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,10,9,4,1000,Y,57661,Sellmark Corporation/Binoculars/Pulsar,,399.970,,Wednesday 12 December 2012 07:01:46 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,908,744105205570,320,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
