171334,SEL-FF13012,raphael,Sellmark Firefield 1 x 30 Combat Sight,Sellmark Firefield 1 x 30 Combat Sight,57,79.990,0,,"* Illuminated red/green dot reticle<br /> <EOL>* Top mounted Iron sights<br /> <EOL>* 8 MOA dot<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><br /> <EOL>* Reticle type: dot<br /> <EOL>* Reticle color: green/red<br /> <EOL>* Reticle brightness settings: 1-5 levels<br /> <EOL>* Finish color: matte black<br /> <EOL>* Magnification: 1x<br /> <EOL>* Objective lens diameter: 30mm<br /> <EOL>* Eyepiece diameter: 24mm<br /> <EOL>* Mount type: weaver<br /> <EOL>* Dimensions: 140mm x 40mm x 80mm<br /> <EOL>* Lens coatings: multi-coated<br /> <EOL>* Battery type: LR936, AG9, 394, LR45, and D934<br /> <EOL>* Body material: extruded 6063 aluminum<br /> <EOL>* Weight: 11.3 oz.<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Description:</b><br /> <EOL>* The perfect shot is always in sight with the Firefield 1x30 Combat Sight!<br /> <EOL>* Featuring an illuminated red/green dot reticle, the Firefield 1x30 Combat Sight has up to five brightness settings that can adapt to any terrain.<br /> <EOL>* Top mounted iron sights provide a secondary aiming system and an 8 MOA dot provides quick target acquisition, perfect for combat situations when it is paramount to find the reticle quickly.<br /> <EOL>* The Firefield 1x30 Combat Sight features a durable, aluminum, die-cast construction and multi-coated lenses for a crisp, clear image.<br /> <EOL>* Able to fit most weaver mounts, the Firefield 1x30 Combat Sight is a must have accessory for any tactical shooter.<br /> <EOL>* Protected by a manufactures warranty and the quality that comes with the Firefield name, the Firefield 1x30 Combat Sight takes any shooter to the next level.<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Included Accessories:</b><br /> <EOL>* 3x AG5 batteries<br /> <EOL>* Lens cloth",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,18,15,15,1000,Y,57714,Sellmark Corporation/Riflescopes/Firefield,,76.190,,Sunday 18 November 2012 04:36:27 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,881,810119013064,64,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
176367,SEL-FF23012,raphael,Sellmark Firefield 1000 Lumen Spotlight Kit,Sellmark Firefield 1000 Lumen Spotlight Kit,39,0,0,," <EOL>* Lightweight / easy to carry<br /> <EOL>* Shockproof<br /> <EOL>* Long distance / high brightness -1000 lumen beam<br /> <EOL>* Quick release mount - attaches to 1” and 30mm riflescopes and shotgun barrels<br /> <EOL>* Red filter and battery carrying case included<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><br /> <EOL>* Bulb type: 100W halogen<br /> <EOL>* Light intensity: 1000 lumens<br /> <EOL>* Battery: 12V. AH lead acid<br /> <EOL>* Battery life: 500 cycles<br /> <EOL>* Head diameter: 150mm<br /> <EOL>* Weight: spotlight 1.1lbs<br /> <EOL>* Weight: kit 11lbs<br /> <EOL>* Material: ABS Plastic<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Description:</b><br /> <EOL>* Get hands-free convenience and be victorious over pesky varmints with the Firefield 1, 000 Lumen Spotlight.<br /> <EOL>* With its 1000 lumen beam, the Firefield 1, 000 Lumen Spotlight performs over long distances with maximum brightness.<br /> <EOL>* Easily attachable to one inch or 30 millimeter riflescopes and shotgun barrels, it features a quick release mount for convenient maneuvering, so multiple rifles and shotguns can be used for varmint hunting.<br /> <EOL>* Featuring a red lens cover, that is untraceable to varmints, the Firefield 1, 000 Lumen Spotlight offers an astounding 10 hours of battery life when fully charged, eliminating the worry of wasted precious seconds.<br /> <EOL>* Its lightweight and easily portable body frame makes a seamless addition for anyone looking to protect their property from hogs, coyotes and other pests.<br /> <EOL>* Complete with a sleek battery case, the Firefield 1, 000 Lumen Spotlight is shockproof tested and comes with a manufactures warranty, ensuring its quality is always worthy of the Firefield name.<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Included Accessories:</b><br /> <EOL>* Riflescope/Shotgun barrel Mount<br /> <EOL>* Rechargeable battery<br /> <EOL>* Red filter<br /> <EOL>* Battery carrying case",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,22.250,21,10,1000,Y,54350,Sellmark Corporation/Flashlights/Firefield,,121.470,,Tuesday 11 December 2012 04:39:12 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,881,810119014108,80,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
170973,SEL-FF11017K,raphael,Sellmark Firefield 20-60 x 60SE Spotting Scope Kit,Sellmark Firefield 20-60 x 60SE Spotting Scope Kit,38.500,84.990,0,," <EOL>* IPX6 waterproof<br /> <EOL>* Nitrogen purged<br /> <EOL>* Durable construction<br /> <EOL>* Multicoated optics<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><br /> <EOL>* Magnification (x): 20-60<br /> <EOL>* Objective lens diameter (mm): 60<br /> <EOL>* Lens focus (mm): 340<br /> <EOL>* Close focus (ft/m): 15ft/5m<br /> <EOL>* Relative aperture: 1: 5.6<br /> <EOL>* Field of view (m @1000m): 37-19<br /> <EOL>* Field of view (°): 2.1-1.08<br /> <EOL>* Field of view (ft @1000yds): 110-57<br /> <EOL>* Focus range (m): 5m to ∞<br /> <EOL>* Exit pupil diameter (mm): 3.15-1.05<br /> <EOL>* Eye relief (mm): 17-13.5<br /> <EOL>* Diopter adjustment (dpt): -4~+8<br /> <EOL>* Resolution (ang.Min ): 4""<br /> <EOL>* Waterproof/nitrogen filled (yes/no): yes<br /> <EOL>* Shockproof (yes/no): no<br /> <EOL>* Fog proof (yes/no): yes<br /> <EOL>* Body material: Plastic<br /> <EOL>* Lens material/type: Optical Glass<br /> <EOL>* Lens coatings: Fully Multi Coated<br /> <EOL>* Operating temperature (°С): 0-40<br /> <EOL>* Tripod mount (in): 1/4<br /> <EOL>* Camera adaptable (yes/no): yes<br /> <EOL>* Length (mm): 350<br /> <EOL>* Width (mm): 145<br /> <EOL>* Height (mm): 75<br /> <EOL>* Weight (oz): 22.5<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Description:</b><br /> <EOL>* The Firefield 20-60x60SE Spotting Scope Kit is blazing a new trail in spotting scope category.<br /> <EOL>* A practical, yet elegant design is the foundation on which the scope was built, improving upon earlier spotting scope models, and making it one of the most technologically advanced to date.<br /> <EOL>* Versatility is the name of the game with this scope.<br /> <EOL>* Its wide magnification range makes it perfect for target shooting and long distance game tracking.<br /> <EOL>* Fully multicoated lenses and a durable body come standard with the Firefield 20-60x60SE Spotting Scope Kit.<br /> <EOL>* A comfortable rubber eyepiece, with the help of a quick focus knob, helps zero in on the quarry at short or long distances.<br /> <EOL>* The Firefield 20-60x60SE Spotting Scope also features a nitrogen purged body with a built in sunshade for reduced glare and added protection from rain.<br /> <EOL>* With an additional camera mounting accessory sold separately, the Firefield 20-60x60SE Spotting Scope can create high magnification digiscope images with the click of a button and its heavy duty tripod, stows easily and securely into the durable nylon carrying case with shoulder strap.<br /> <EOL>* With this scope, the only thing that will burn is a passion and thrill for the outdoors!<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Included Accessories:</b><br /> <EOL>* Adjustable Tripod",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,27,16.500,15,1000,Y,57720,Sellmark Corporation/Spotting Scopes/Firefield,,85.220,,Friday 16 November 2012 05:34:00 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,881,810119017260,56,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
