172961,SEL-SM11026K,randy,Sellmark Sightmark 15-45x60SE Spotting Scope Kit,Sellmark Sightmark 15-45x60SE Spotting Scope Kit,42,0,0,," <EOL>* Built in Sunshade<br /> <EOL>* Compact <br /> <EOL>* Lightweight<br /> <EOL>* Waterproof<br /> <EOL>* Rubber textured<br /> <EOL>* Bright image<br /> <EOL>* Vivid colors <br /> <EOL>* Clear, high-resolution optics<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Specifications:</b><br /> <EOL>* Objective Lens: 60mm<br /> <EOL>* Magnification: 15 - 45x<br /> <EOL>* Field of View: 136 - 66(ft @1000yds)<br /> <EOL>* Focus range: 15ft - infinite<br /> <EOL>* Exit pupil diameter: 4.0 - 1.35 mm<br /> <EOL>* Eye relief: 17.9 - 14.8 mm<br /> <EOL>* Diopter Adjustment: -4 - +8<br /> <EOL>* Waterproof/nitrogen filled: Yes<br /> <EOL>* Shockproof: Yes<br /> <EOL>* Fog Proof: Yes<br /> <EOL>* Lens coating: Fully multi colored<br /> <EOL>* Camera adaptable: Yes<br /> <EOL>* Dimensions: 350 x 100 x 75 mm<br /> <EOL>* Weight: 22.6 oz.<br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL><b>Description:</b><br /> <EOL>* the Sightmark 15-45x60SE Spotting Scope Kit is the ideal spotting scope for anyone who depends on the highest quality optics designed for extra long distance.<br /> <EOL>* With built-in sunshade and filter kit, the fully multi-coated optics are protected from glare and other light distortions, ensuring the clearest image possible.<br /> <EOL>* Sightmark's compact, lightweight spotting scope features a wide field of view, so hunters can spot their prey easily with precision accuracy.<br /> <EOL>* The versatility of the Sightmark 15-45x60SE Spotting Scope lends itself to solo target shooting, observation and long distance game tracking. the 45x magnification provides long range function for seeing details to identify objects, vital for use in stake outs, police surveillance or sniper spotters.<br /> <EOL>* The support from the precision focus tripod allows the user to quickly make any fine adjustments in the field.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark 15-45x60SE Spotting Scope features a nitrogen purged body and durable construction, protected by Sightmark's Limited Lifetime Warranty.<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Included Accessories:</b><br /> <EOL>* Tactical hard case,<br /> <EOL>* Durable nylon carrying case<br /> <EOL>* Precision focus tripod with fine tune adjustments,<br /> <EOL>* Protective dust/sun lens filter,<br /> <EOL>* Fog lens filter,<br /> <EOL>* Window mount,<br /> <EOL>* Objective lens cover,<br /> <EOL>* Special lens cleaning cloth,<br /> <EOL>* Built-in sun shade <EOL>",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,27.500,16.500,15.500,1000,Y,57721,Sellmark Corporation/Spotting Scopes/Sightmark,,97.290,,Saturday 24 November 2012 09:35:26 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,886,810119016614,64,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
175484,SEL-SM19021,randy,Sellmark Sightmark 5x Tactical Magnifier,Sellmark Sightmark 5x Tactical Magnifier,40,0,0,," <EOL>* Increases magnification of accompanying sights for greater sighting range<br /> <EOL>* Improved target recognition, especially at medium range distances<br /> <EOL>* EOTech and Aimpoint compatible<br /> <EOL>* Precision accuracy<br /> <EOL>* Wide field of view<br /> <EOL>* Quick target acquisition<br /> <EOL>* Multicoated optics<br /> <EOL>* Waterproof, Fog proof, Shockproof, Lightweight<br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL><b>Specifications: </b><br /> <EOL>* Magnification (x): 5<br /> <EOL>* Objective (mm): 29<br /> <EOL>* Eye relief (mm): 53<br /> <EOL>* Field of view (degrees): 6<br /> <EOL>* Tube diameter (in): 30<br /> <EOL>* Material: aluminum<br /> <EOL>* Color: matte black<br /> <EOL>* Dimensions (in): 130x48x45<br /> <EOL>* Weight (oz): 7.3<br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL><b>Description: </b><br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark series of Tactical Magnifiers are multifunctional weapons accessories inspired by military and law enforcement applications.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark 5x Tactical Magnifier is designed for use in conjunction with holographic, collimated reflex, and other compatible weapons sights, giving the shooter the benefit of a close range reflex sight and long range scope in one combination.<br /> <EOL>* The magnifier increases the magnification of the accompanying sight for greater sighting range and improves target recognition, especially at medium to long range distances.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark 5x Tactical Magnifier can assist in quick target acquisition up to 350 yards and accurate target shooting at 150 yards the Sightmark Tactical Magnifier also features extended eye relief for comfort, a wide field of view for superior target acquisition and high quality multi-coated optics for improved visibility and clarity.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark 5x Tactical Magnifier can be mounted on most picatinny and weaver mounts and is designed to work with EOTech, Aimpoint, Trijicon and other brands.<br /> <EOL>* A lightweight, waterproof, fog proof and shatter-proof frame provides durability in all elements.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark 3x, 5x and 7x magnifiers can also be coupled with the Sightmark 30mm slide to side mount, therefore eliminating the need for constant attaching and removal.<br /> <EOL>* With all its features, included accessories and manufactures warranty, the Sightmark 3x Tactical Magnifier is a must-have accessory for any shooter's well-stocked arsenal.<br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL><b>Included Accessories: </b><br /> <EOL>* Heavy duty 30mm Weaver mount<br /> <EOL>* Hex wrench<br /> <EOL>* Limited Lifetime Warranty",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,19,19,18,1000,Y,54353,Sellmark Corporation/Accessories/Sightmark,,121.470,,Thursday 06 December 2012 03:17:56 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,886,810119012302,80,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
