265535,SEL-SM25002,fahad,Sellmark Sightmark CGL Triple Duty Green Laser,Sellmark Sightmark CGL Triple Duty Green Laser,0.320,179.990,149.970,,"* When seconds count, you don't have time to find your sights in the dark.<br /> <EOL>* Featuring a compact design to easily and securely fit pistols, the Sightmark Triple Duty Compact Green Laser (CGL) pin-points targets faster than lightening.<br /> <EOL>* The lightweight, streamlined laser mounts between the trigger guard and muzzle of any railed handgun, decreasing snag points and refraining from adding unnecessary weight to the firearm.<br /> <EOL>* Visibility extends to 50 yards during the day and an impressive 600 yards at night.<br /> <EOL>* The CGL is energized by a CR2 battery and features two modes, continuous and pulsing, to increase battery life up to 15 hours.<br /> <EOL>* With ambidextrous digital on/off switches, the 5 mW laser can be activated by the right- or left-handed shooter.<br /> <EOL>* The included pressure pad allows the unit to conveniently mount on the quad rail of various AR platforms.<br /> <EOL>* Designed with a weaver/picatinny mount, the CGL has an operating temperature range of 0°F to 120°F, making it the laser of your choice for almost every shooting scenario.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,4.500,3.750,1.500,1000,Y,57678,Sellmark Corporation/Laser Sights/Sightmark,,150.330,,Thursday 05 December 2013 11:05:20 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,886,810119017819,120,55,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
