<br /> <EOL>* Recognition range, approx.<br /> <EOL>* - quarter moon (m): 225<br /> <EOL>* - cloud cover (m): 175<br /> <EOL>* IR illuminator effective distance (m): Up to 5<br /> <EOL>* Limited Warranty<br /> <EOL>* Housing and components (year): 5<br /> <EOL>* Image intensifier tube (year): 3<br /> <EOL> <br /> <EOL> <b>Description: </b><br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark PVS-14 is an extremely versatile, military inspired night vision unit that can be hand-held, head mounted with use of included head gear or helmet mount, weapon mounted and is photo/video adaptable.<br /> <EOL>* The PVS-14 features an integrated 5mW adjustable IR illuminator, which provides illumination during night vision mode and a low battery/IR indicator, automatic brightness control, which lets the user know when the unit has low battery.<br /> <EOL>* The PVS-14 can be co-witnessed with night vision compatible weapons sights with weapons mount accessories.<br /> <EOL>* This unit is based on the most advanced image intensifiers, with 64 lp/mm for a better resolution.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark PVS-14 features an automatic shut-off, which turns off the unit when it is exposed to bright light sources, and an automatic brightness control that saves battery life.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark PVS-14 is a Generation 3 night vision unit that produces higher resolution than other night vision models and gives the user more range of sight.<br /> <EOL>* Lightweight and waterproof, the Sightmark PVS-14 is a must have accessory for the serious night vision enthusiast.<br /> <EOL>* Protected by a three year warranty on the tube and a Lifetime Warranty on the housing, the Sightmark PVS-14 Gen 3 Kit is engineered to meet the highest requirements and standards and will keep up with the most intense user.<br /> <EOL> <br /> <EOL> <b>Included Accessories: </b><br /> <EOL>* Head mount assembly<br /> <EOL>* Brow pads<br /> <EOL>* Helmet / head mount adapter<br /> <EOL>* Eye cup<br /> <EOL>* Carrying case with shoulder strap<br /> <EOL>* Safety lanyard<br /> <EOL>* Lens cap<br /> <EOL>* Lens paper<br /> <EOL>* Limited Warranty",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,12,8,4,1000,Y,57695,Sellmark Corporation/Night Vision Goggles/Sightmark,,3943.010,,Sunday 02 December 2012 10:38:53 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,886,810119011855,2610,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
