265536,SEL-SM73008K,fahad,Sellmark Sightmark SS2000 Flashlight,Sellmark Sightmark SS2000 Flashlight,2,215.990,179.970,,"* The Sightmark SS2000 Tactical flashlight features Cree LEDs to provide 2000 lumens of light for the most difficult shots or furthest point in the dark of night.<br /> <EOL>* The SS2000 Triple Duty flashlight is constructed with Type II mil-spec anodizing aircraft grade aluminum for durability and protection against corrosion.<br /> <EOL>* Equipped with a selector switch that cycles through three settings; 2, 000 lumen, 280 lumen or strobe, the Sightmark SS2000 makes a great additional to any tactical or hunting kit.<br /> <EOL>* The unique strobe mode feature of the Sightmark SS2000 extends the applications to emergency situations as an alert or as a decoy to distract and disorient targets.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark SS2000 Tactical flashlight is equipped with two rechargeable batteries, a battery recharger, a weapon mount, on/off push button, pressure switch and three filters.<br /> <EOL>* The filters included are green, red and blue filters that maximize product use.<br /> <EOL>* Green filters assist in map reading, while red filters help to preserve night vision and assist with varmint hunting, so hunters can avoid being detected by their prey.<br /> <EOL>* Blue filters are also used by hunters and assist in illuminating blood trails.<br /> <EOL>* The unit is recoil resistant, waterproof, lightweight and protected by Sightmark's limited lifetime warranty.<br /> <EOL>* This is the perfect addition to the award winning Triple Duty Series- shooting, hunting, tactical as well as for camping, hiking, home use and vehicle emergencies.<br /> <EOL>* Sightmark-Make Your Mark!",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,10.500,6,2.500,1000,Y,57677,Sellmark Corporation/Flashlights/Sightmark,,179.970,,Thursday 05 December 2013 11:12:16 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,886,810119018885,144,55,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
