175336,SEL-YK21031K,fahad,Sightmark 6-100x100 Angled Eyepiece Tripod Kit Tactical Case Black,Sightmark 6-100x100 Angled Eyepiece Tripod Kit Tactical Case Black,8,479.990,399.970,,"* Dual objective lenses with a folded light path for compact size and light weight<br /> <EOL>* 6-100x zoom variable magnification<br /> <EOL>* Tripod included<br /> <EOL>* Digital camera adaptable with optional accessory<br /> <EOL>* Eyepiece rotates 90 degrees for viewing at any angle<br /> <EOL>* Lightweight with both 25mm and 100mm objective lenses for optimal performance<br /> <EOL>* Fully multicoated lenses for increased light transmission<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Specifications: </b><br /> <EOL>* Magnification (x): 6-25 25-100<br /> <EOL>* Lens diameter (mm): 25 100<br /> <EOL>* Eye relief (mm): 12 16<br /> <EOL>* Exit pupil diameter (mm): 1 4<br /> <EOL>* Field of view (°): 7-2.5 2.5-0.6<br /> <EOL>* Field of view (yd @ 1000yds): 39 11<br /> <EOL>* Minimal focusing distance (yd): 1<br /> <EOL>* Diopter adjustment (dptr): +5, -5<br /> <EOL>* Tripod socket (in): 1/4<br /> <EOL>* Dimensions (in): 16.7x4.7x6.5<br /> <EOL>* Weight (oz): 53<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Description: </b><br /> <EOL>* The Yukon™ 6-100x100 is a revolutionary spotting scope that provides a high quality image at magnifications ranging from 6x to 100x.<br /> <EOL>* For low magnification observation, the device utilizes the 25mm lens.<br /> <EOL>* Linear zooming allows magnification adjustments between 6x and 25x but, when a higher magnification is desired, the flip of a switch shifts the light path from one lens to the other.<br /> <EOL>* With the 100mm objective lens, zooming capabilities increase to 25−100x magnification.<br /> <EOL>* The enormous light gathering capability of the 100mm lens creates a bright and clear picture in nearly all viewing conditions, including twilight.<br /> <EOL>* In accordance to Yukon Advanced Optics' tradition, the Yukon 100x's design provides the user with power, quality and comfort.<br /> <EOL>* To prevent viewing fatigue or discomfort, a specially designed adjustable 45-degree, rotating eyepiece is utilized to suit the viewer's position from any angle, even when lying on the ground.<br /> <EOL>* Both digital and photo camera adapters are available to be used with the Yukon 100x.<br /> <EOL>* The unit can accommodate both photographic and spotting scope tripods, and can double as a telescope for late night stargazing.<br /> <EOL>* The 100x is backed by Yukon's Limited Lifetime Warranty.<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Included Accessories: </b><br /> <EOL>* 100x table top tripod<br /> <EOL>* Objective lens cover<br /> <EOL>* Protective carrying case<br /> <EOL>* Sun shield",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,18.500,7.500,6.750,1000,Y,57721,Sellmark Corporation/Spotting Scopes/Sightmark,,399.970,,Thursday 06 December 2012 01:51:06 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,897,744105200773,280,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
