175799,SEL-SM19026,mohammad,Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier Slide to Side,Sellmark Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier Slide to Side,1,167.990,139.970,,"* Increases magnification of accompanying sights for greater sighting range<br /> <EOL>* Improved target recognition, especially at medium range distances<br /> <EOL>* EOTech and Aimpoint compatible<br /> <EOL>* Precision accuracy<br /> <EOL>* Wide field of view<br /> <EOL>* Quick target acquisition<br /> <EOL>* Multicoated optics<br /> <EOL>* Waterproof, Fog proof, Shockproof, Lightweight<br /> <EOL> <br /> <EOL> <b>Specifications: </b><br /> <EOL>* Magnification (x): 7<br /> <EOL>* Objective (mm): 32<br /> <EOL>* Eye relief (mm): 50<br /> <EOL>* Field of view (degrees): 5<br /> <EOL>* Tube diameter (in): 30<br /> <EOL>* Material: aluminum<br /> <EOL>* Color: matte black<br /> <EOL>* Dimensions (in): 147x48x45<br /> <EOL>* Weight (oz): 7.7<br /> <EOL> <br /> <EOL> <b>Description: </b><br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark series of Tactical Magnifiers are multifunctional weapons accessories inspired by military and law enforcement applications.<br /> <EOL>* Featuring a slide to side mount, the Sightmark Tactical Magnifier gives the shooter quick target acquisition capabilities, with the ability to quickly move the magnifier out of the way without having to detach the unit.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier with the slide to side mount is designed for use in conjunction with holographic, collimated reflex, and other compatible weapons sights, giving the shooter the benefit of a reflex sight and scope in one combination.<br /> <EOL>* The magnifier increases the magnification of the accompanying sight for greater sighting range and improves target recognition, especially at long range distances.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier can assist in quick target acquisition over 350 yards and accurate target shooting at 200 yards.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark Tactical Magnifier also features extended eye relief for added comfort, a wide field of view for superior target acquisition and high quality multi-coated optics for improved visibility and clarity.<br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier features high-magnification for long-distance target acquisition.<br /> <EOL>* Designed to work with EOTech, Aimpoint, Trijicon and other brands the Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier can be mounted on most picatinny and weaver mounts.<br /> <EOL>* A lightweight, waterproof, fog proof and shatter-proof frame provides durability in all elements.<br /> <EOL>* With all its features, included accessories and manufactures warranty, the Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier is a must-have accessory for any shooter's well-stocked arsenal.<br /> <EOL> <br /> <EOL> <b>Included Accessories: </b><br /> <EOL>* Slide to side mount",,1000000,2,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,9.500,3,2.500,1000,Y,57683,Sellmark Corporation/Magnifiers/Sightmark,,140.310,,Saturday 08 December 2012 01:16:48 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,886,810119016966,112,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
