175859,SEL-SM26001,mohammad,Sightmark Core Shot,Sellmark Sightmark Core Shot,0.500,155.990,129.970,,"* Weaver/picatinny mount<br /> <EOL>* Reliable and durable<br /> <EOL>* Digital switch<br /> <EOL>* 5 reticle brightness settings<br /> <EOL>* 3 moa red dot<br /> <EOL>* Parallax corrected for precision accuracy<br /> <EOL>* Wide field of view<br /> <EOL>* Low power consumption<br /> <EOL>* Lightweight<br /> <EOL>* Shockproof<br /> <EOL>* Weatherproof<br /> <EOL> <br /> <EOL> <b>Specifications: </b><br /> <EOL>* Reticle type: dot<br /> <EOL>* Reticle color: red<br /> <EOL>* Illuminated: yes<br /> <EOL>* Reticle brightness settings: 1-5 and off<br /> <EOL>* Finish/color: matte black<br /> <EOL>* Magnification (x): 1x<br /> <EOL>* Objective lens size (mm): 28x19<br /> <EOL>* Eye relief (mm): unlimited<br /> <EOL>* Field of view (m @100m): 22.7<br /> <EOL>* Field of view (ft @100yd): 74.5<br /> <EOL>* Parallax free @ (yds): 10yds to infinity<br /> <EOL>* Windage (MOA): 165<br /> <EOL>* Elevation (MOA): 140<br /> <EOL>* Windage & Elevation lock: yes<br /> <EOL>* Maximum recoil (G's): 1, 000<br /> <EOL>* Battery type: CR2032<br /> <EOL>* Battery life (hours): 270-high<br /> <EOL>* Battery voltage (V): 3V<br /> <EOL>* Sunshade: No<br /> <EOL>* Nitrogen filled: No<br /> <EOL>* Shockproof: Yes<br /> <EOL>* Fog proof: no<br /> <EOL>* Focal plane: NA<br /> <EOL>* Waterproof IP Standard: IPX4 - weatherproof (rain, snow, sleet)<br /> <EOL>* Body material: aluminum<br /> <EOL>* Lens coatings: AR Red<br /> <EOL>* Mount type: weaver/picatinny<br /> <EOL>* Operating temperature (°F): -20 to 140<br /> <EOL>* Length (mm) w/ protective hood: 47<br /> <EOL>* Width (mm) w/ protective hood: 30<br /> <EOL>* Height (mm) w/ protective hood: 39<br /> <EOL>* Weight (oz): 1.3<br /> <EOL> <br /> <EOL> <b>Description: </b><br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark Core Shot Reflex Sight is a unique, midsized, lightweight reflex sight in the Sightmark reflex sight family.<br /> <EOL>* The Core Shot is available 