cessories to the unit, ensuring a beefed up arsenal.<br /> <EOL>* With 5 brightness settings located on a rotary switch and constructed from aircraft grade aluminum, the Ultra Shot Z Series is ideal for any lighting condition and durable enough to withstand high recoil so you never have worry about poor performance when zombies attack!<br /> <EOL>* Designed to return to the rail and still hold zero, the Sightmark Z Series eliminates in-the-field adjustments making it reliable to take out the undead in an instant.<br /> <EOL>* Featuring a wide field of view, it is useful for close quarter combat to mid-range target shooting.<br /> <EOL>* The Ultra Shot Z Series features a weaver mount and matte black finish eliminating reflections.<br /> <EOL>* Highly durable and accurate, this is one product that is a must have to kill the undead (again) and save your brains!<br /><br /> <EOL><b>Included Accessories: </b><br /> <EOL>* Adjustment tools<br /> <EOL>* Replacement battery<br /> <EOL>* Sight cover",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,4.500,3.500,2,1000,Y,57711,Sellmark Corporation/Reflex Sights/Sightmark,,121.270,,Sunday 25 November 2012 02:13:34 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,886,810119018540,96,50,N,171,Sellmark Corporation
176041,SEL-SM39014,fahad,Sightmark Universal Boresight,Sellmark Sightmark Universal Boresight,0.030,41.990,34.970,,"* Works on all rifles and pistols<br /> <EOL>* More accurate than arbor type bore sights<br /> <EOL>* Precision accuracy<br /> <EOL>* Reliable and durable<br /> <EOL>* Fastest gun zeroing and sighting system<br /> <EOL>* Reduce wasted cartridges and shells<br /> <EOL>* Compact and lightweight<br /> <EOL>* Easy to pack and travel<br /> <EOL>* Comes with a carrying case<br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL><b>Specifications: </b><br /> <EOL>* Laser wavelength (nm): 632-650<br /> <EOL>* LED type: visible red laser<br /> <EOL>* Power (mW): < 5<br /> <EOL>* Battery type (AG3) 3<br /> <EOL>* Battery life (hour): 1<br /> <EOL>* Range for sighting (yd): 15-100<br /> <EOL>* Dot size (in @ 100yds): 2<br /> <EOL>* Operation: on/off end cap<br /> <EOL>* Construction: brass<br /> <EOL>* Temperature (°): -10-50<br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL><b>Description: </b><br /> <EOL>* The Sightmark Universal Laser Bore Sight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in rifles and pistols of all types.<br /> <EOL>* Simply place the base of the bore sight onto the end of the barrel of your weapon and it will attach magnetically.<br /> <EOL>* A laser dot will show exactly where your gun is aiming; it's easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot.<br /> <EOL>* Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance.<br /> <EOL>* Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement, the Sightmark™ Universal laser bore sight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun.<br /> <EOL>* It's easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range; use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt.<br /> <EOL>* A lightweight carrying pouch protects the bore sight for convenient use in the field.